### Create a new QTE Prompt
POST http://localhost:5000/qte-prompts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "difficulty": 666,
  "timeLimit": 5,
  "points": 200
}

### Get all prompts (Use three hashtags to separate requests)
GET http://localhost:5000/qte-prompts

### filter prompts
GET http://localhost:5000/qte-prompts?key=SPACE&difficulty=hard

