### Create Prompt
POST http://localhost:5000/qte-prompts/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "key": "r"
}

### update prompt
PUT http://localhost:5000/qte-prompts/6abd51a357f67ec12d7d3e95
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "key": "W",
}

